ler_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "1171020204116800", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75393560_1171020207450133_8492329113192424785_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PRuAX_uP6uoQ7kNvwFiEMuA&_nc_oc=AdqrTXT3xBOmyYFWiBWW5QID25RSXKCm4w1gPcuGxigLXeX32CKC8HbviKN2gk2hx0o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6FUeZ2e2ZVUdJYUj4OIr88U0KuvgTs0T0QIuuqVBcdGQ&oe=6A00979A"}, "display_name": "Ninja's Last Stand", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In a world torn apart by war and chaos, the ancient art of the ninja is the last hope for survival. As the world descends into darkness, you, a skilled ninja warrior, must defend against relentless assaults using your katana and futuristic gun. Set against the backdrop of a war-torn landscape illuminated by the dying light of the setting sun, \"Ninja's Last Stand\" immerses you in a gripping narrative of honor, duty, and survival.\nKey Features\n\n1. Immersive VR Experience\n\n    Step into a fully immersive VR world where every slash of your katana and every shot from your gun feels real. The high-fidelity graphics and realistic soundscapes create an unparalleled sense of presence and engagement.", "short_description": "Storyline\n\nIn a world torn apart by war and chaos, the ancient art of the ninja is the last hope for survival. As the world descends into darkness, you, a skilled ninja warrior, must defend against relentless assaults using your katana and futuristic gun. Set against the backdrop of a war-torn landscape illuminated by the dying light of the setting sun, \"Ninja's Last Stand\" immerses you in a gripping narrative of honor, duty, and survival."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/ninjas-last-stand/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "WHR26 Invention", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/ninjas-last-stand